## 📖 Overview

This project implements a **12kW industrial heater control system** for an alkaline plating bath. Uses ATmega328P to manage three 4kW immersion heaters with temperature control and safety interlocks.

**Key Features:**
- Temperature control via PT100 sensor
- Water level safety interlock
- 3-phase 380V AC power switching (SSR)
- Real-time serial debugging
- Complete Proteus simulation

