### ATmega328P DIP-28 Pin Mapping

| Arduino Pin | Chip Pin | Component | Direction |
|-------------|----------|-----------|-----------|
| A0 | Pin 23 (PC0) | PT100 Sensor | Input |
| D2 | Pin 4 (PD2) | Level Sensor | Input |
| **D11** | **Pin 17 (PB3)** | **SSR Control** | **Output** |
| TX | Pin 2 (PD0) | Serial TX | Output |
| RX | Pin 3 (PD1) | Serial RX | Input |

**Power:**
- Pin 7 (VCC) → +5V
- Pin 8 (GND) → GND
- Pin 20 (AVCC) → +5V
- Pin 22 (GND) → GND

